      "tags": ["extended", "firecrawl", "approval", "external_write"],
      "notes": "预期治理层在远端 handler 执行前停止；本阶段不实现 approval resume。"
    },
    {
      "id": "mixed-local-rag-001",
      "version": 2,
      "suite": "mixed",
      "category": "cross_tool_local_rag",
      "mcp_servers": ["github", "firecrawl"],
      "question": "学生办理缓考或免考时，线上填报入口是什么？外网访问有什么要求？",
      "expected": {
        "decision": "use_agent",
        "action": "agent",
        "status": "OK",
        "first_tool": "search_knowledge_base",
        "tools_contains": ["search_knowledge_base"],
        "tool_origin": "local",
        "keywords": ["综合业务系统", "学生服务", "校园网", "VPN"],
        "min_keyword_hits": 2,
        "sources": ["关于调整缓考、免考办理流程的通知.md"],
        "source_match": "any"
      },
      "tags": ["extended", "mixed", "local_rag", "cross_tool_selection"]
    },
